    "title": "Rowe leads No. 15 Haddonfield to win over Gateway - Baseball recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Advance Local Express Desk Jake Tiger ,\n1 days ago James Rowe went 2-for-2 with two RBIs to lead Haddonfield, 15th in the NJ.com Top 20, to a 4-1 victory over Gateway in Haddonfield. Haddonfield (4-1) extended its win streak to four games behind a strong pitching performance from Eli Clark, who struck out six batters over three innings while allowing no runs and three walks to earn the win. The home team jumped out to an early 2-0 lead in the first inning and added single runs in the second and sixth innings to secure the victory. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
